From 25c8e40905d98f056622044970dc6dc345e118fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: itar3 <62651854+itar3@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:02:15 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Renderer-specific: lazy clears as load actions, MoltenVK
 barrier shortcut, pass statistics

Kept out of the upstream series: full clears are deferred and applied as
the load action of the next pass that draws into the image (a pending list
shared by the command lists, aged by lazyClearsEndFrame), texture barriers
on MoltenVK skip ending the pass when no attachment of the active pass is
involved (valid on Metal only), and pass statistics and a per-pass trace
for diagnostics. g_lazyPassSwitch can turn the persistent render pass off.
